# Ketra Orc support (KetraOrcSupport): a Ketra ally of level 5 holding 6 horns buys Haste from the soul guide;
# Asefa answers the bought page, takes the 6 horns and, on a later AI tick, casts Haste (4357, level 1) on the
# ally. The soul guide is a civilian with the MP the blessing costs (a civilian's maximum is the npc line's mp).
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (KetraOrcSupport.onAdvEvent).
character Ally 40
standing 5
hold 7186 6
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
item 7186
page script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/
npc asefa 31372 Folk 20 0 0 mp 1493

action asefa
action asefa
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=asefa item=0 page=script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/31372-4.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest KetraOrcSupport 7
  S SystemMessage id=301 3:7186 6:6
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=asefa item=0 page=script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/31372-4.htm
  S ActionFailed
  items 7186=0
tick x3
  S MagicSkillUse caster=asefa target=player skill=4357-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4357,1
